=\\frac{2}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534905 true] [17592186318691 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318692 13194139534905 true] [17592186318691 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534905 true] [17592186318691 1041 "field-1" 13194139534905 true] [17592186318691 1104 #edb/ref 17592186318692 13194139534905 true] [17592186318691 1110 #uuid "978ff4cd-46ce-58c1-b0ec-dd9028e5f23b" 13194139534905 true] [17592186318692 1034 "\\frac{2}{3}" 13194139534905 true] [17592186318692 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534905 true] [17592186318692 1111 #uuid "900a4ff5-ab72-5fc3-8f2b-ff2a29fe4a9d" 13194139534905 true] [17592186318693 1017 #edb/ref 17592186318694 13194139534905 true] [17592186318693 1089 "q-76112" 13194139534905 true] [17592186318693 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534905 true] [17592186318693 1100 "Consider the function $f(x)=(x+2)\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x+1).$ Given that $y=f(x)$ is invertible throughout its domain, determine $({f}^{-1})^{′}(0).$" 13194139534905 true] [17592186318693 1113 #uuid "d191fb44-ba38-563d-8487-657d2de79864" 13194139534905 true] [17592186318693 1145 "To determine $({f}^{-1})^{′}(0),$ we use the following formula:\n\n$$\n{({f}^{-1})}^{′}(0)=\\frac{1}{{f}^{′}({f}^{-1}(0))}\n$$\n\nFirst, we calculate the value of ${f}^{-1}(0).$ To do this, we solve the equation ${f}^{-1}(0)=x.$ This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{-1}(0) & =x \\\\ f(x) & =0 \\\\ (x+2)\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x+1) & =0 \\\\ x & =-2,\\,0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe discard $x=-2$ since the logarithm is not defined for negative numbers. Therefore, ${f}^{-1}(0)=0.$\n\nNow, we calculate ${f}^{′}(0),$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =(x+2)\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x+1) \\\\ {f}^{′}(x) & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x+1)+\\frac{2(x+2)}{2x+1} \\\\ {f}^{′}(0) & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2\\cdot 0+1)+\\frac{2(0+2)}{2\\cdot 0+1} \\\\ {f}^{′}(0) & =0+4 \\\\ {f}^{′}(0) & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{({f}^{-1})}^{′}(0) & =\\frac{1}{{f}^{′}({f}^{-1}(0))} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{f}^{′}(0)} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534905 true] [17592186318694 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318695 13194139534905 true] [17592186318694 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318696 13194139534905 true] [17592186318694 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318697 13194139534905 true] [17592186318694 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318698 13194139534905 true] [17592186318694 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318699 13194139534905 true] [17592186318694 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534905 true] [17592186318694 1041 "selection" 13194139534905 true] [17592186318694 1104 #edb/ref 17592186318697 13194139534905 true] [17592186318694 1110 #uuid "3cd2f178-5b3a-5305-bf61-f93e8920577f" 13194139534905 true] [17592186318695 1034 "-\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139534905 true] [17592186318695 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534905 true] [17592186318695 1111 #uuid "07b535b7-c7b1-5655-9154-19d1882e8024" 13194139534905 true] [17592186318696 1034 "2" 13194139534905 true] [17592186318696 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534905 true] [17592186318696 1111 #uuid "84f02f1c-f89c-5ab0-9cce-bf5fe822eb94" 13194139534905 true] [17592186318697 1034 "\\frac{1}{4}" 13194139534905 true] [17592186318697 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534905 true] [17592186318697 1111 #uuid "8e38246e-0702-5e0b-b4bb-3eaf7caae475" 13194139534905 true] [17592186318698 1034 "-4" 13194139534905 true] [17592186318698 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534905 true] [17592186318698 1111 #uuid "7ad36b50-c9fb-5e9f-adf8-f9b7d8de536d" 13194139534905 true] [17592186318699 1034 "\\frac{3}{2}" 13194139534905 true] [17592186318699 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534905 true] [17592186318699 1111 #uuid "3593e90c-d3ae-58dc-b59c-336226d5590b" 13194139534905 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-110279" 17592186318676 "q-110279/selection" 17592186318677 "q-110279/selection/2aef90071200a7bc65baa2d03f49803233ca7b2dc16865265136281ee914878b" 17592186318678 "q-110279/selection/4280bcd0914e40dbdc039bc97ee5d5baafd2654e75e9b692316d9c28c4842856" 17592186318679 "q-110279/sel